    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d739">

                <pb facs="0772" n="760" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg760"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/10–645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sands</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-06T13:00:00+03:06">October 6, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 1:02 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>375. ReLegtel 374 October 5. King also wishes to publish at same time his letter
                    of March 10 to President Roosevelt<anchor n="60" xml:id="d739-f1"/> to which
                    latter’s [letter?] of April was in answer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sands</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
